    {
      "uid": "zhcn:922c188d92d8f90b2e1c8722",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "考虑到我们将春季天皇赏作为目标，\r\n这两条路线比起经典三冠而言，\r\n赛程距离都太短了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef7564fa87792ef3aacdf2aa5a627d78bc9c41e95e56a4b3df7982f87e145ed5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
