    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06e587b71d15d7d448b7af49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她垂下脑袋。\r\n不过说来也是。明明是新春时分，\r\n没必要讨论这么严肃的话题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "379be0583df3ac44059dec63b21d29fbe15da273cf830fabe54f1caf7ce3d1e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
