    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9911bf8343569f2b30e953a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在数次自转的间隙时，进行『休息』……\r\n向训练员请求，教导休息方法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "759b0ed4d6b28045ea8448a3180bbb861ffaa42ba266f7b210159de663ac24d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d64d6ae058266a98c35dddf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是“宏观”的新年祝福啊。\r\n不过我没想到，原来新宇宙脑中也是有着\r\n“祝贺”这一概念的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "561471ecd9ae252a9b90a701892e7f595bf5ea4d1cdb985f5889500438eb0625",
