      "uid": "zhcn:233d2c40c971150aa49359e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相信新宇宙吧。无论看上去有多么“尖锐”——\r\n“PATH”都是能通往终点的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0de581187ea357fe8a619e799f9a55aefff8d24bdf0ee8f3700bca0de0046a65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
